u are currently having **fever, active red urine, worsening pain, vomiting, weakness, clots, or difficulty passing urine**, I would favor the **emergency department**.\n\nThis pipeline output is a **preliminary signal, not an actual diagnosis**. It should be interpreted together with formal radiology review, clinician assessment, urine tests, kidney blood tests, and likely updated imaging.\n\nIf you want, the next best step here is to use the **LLM Distillation** tool so I can turn **our whole conversation + your patient history + this pipeline result** into one comprehensive medical report with suggested next steps.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0afa92146ff910270169da61563b108191a432d4cc176f7139\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":10560,"output":581,"cacheRead":16384,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27525,"cost":{"input":0.026400000000000003,"output":0.008715,"cacheRead":0.004096,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.03921100000000001}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775919441874}}
