 alone\n- Do **not** ignore worsening urine output, clots, or fever\n\n**Bottom line**\nThis needs **prompt real-world medical assessment**, and the most important next step is getting seen **today**.\n\nIf you want one final clean handoff document before we close, you can use the **LLM Distillation** tool and I can turn this conversation plus the pipeline result into a concise medical report for you to keep.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0afa92146ff910270169da617e48fc81918d654eec18b5fc1f\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":13324,"output":475,"cacheRead":13952,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27751,"cost":{"input":0.03331,"output":0.007125,"cacheRead":0.0034879999999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.043923}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775919477663}}
